We must check $x = -5.224$ as a potential solution!  At $x = -5.224,$ both sides of the equation are equal, namely $\frac{13}{19.22} \approx 0.678,$ so $x = \boxed{-2.61}^2 + 2 = -5.224$ is the only solution.

